  "summary": "Please do not write me on LinkedIn; unfortunately, due to the volume of messages, I cannot manage this channel effectively.\n\nTogether with an incredibly talented team, we founded FINN in 2019 to build the first true e-commerce experience in the automotive industry.\n\nToday, we offer car subscriptions from over 30 brands in a carefree service package and handle insurance, financing, registration, taxes, and maintenance for our customers. They subscribe to a car with just a few clicks and it will be delivered directly to their doorstep in just a few days. \n\nAt FINN, we drive change for people, organizations, and the planet through frictionless mobility. That’s why we actively push electric vehicles with our risk-free subscription model and allow customers to have the longest test drive in the world.",
